```mermaid
flowchart TD
  A["Code Push (commit to main)"] --> B["Lint & Test"]
  B --> C{"Tests pass?"}
  C -->|"No"| D["Halt pipeline\nNotify dev"]
  C -->|"Yes"| E["Docker Build\nBuild image + push to ECR"]
  E --> F["Staging Deploy\nDeploy to k8s staging"]
  F --> G["Manual Approval\nSenior dev clicks \"Approve\""]
  G --> H["Production Push"]
```

Chosen diagram: flowchart (step-by-step process with a decision gate).
